flowchart TD
    START([Scenario A: Unified Service Scheduler]) --> P1

    subgraph P1["Phase 1 — Discovery & System Design"]
        P1a[Requirements → acceptance criteria]
        P1b[Assumptions list]
        P1c[Domain model]
        P1d[Architecture diagram]
        P1e[Data flow — TBD]
        P1f[Tech choices — TBD]
    end

    subgraph P2["Phase 2 — Scaffolding"]
        P2a[Project setup]
        P2b[PostgreSQL + exclusion constraints<br/>Redis read cache]
        P2c[CI pipeline]
    end

    subgraph P3["Phase 3 — Core Features"]
        R1[R1: Resource-constrained booking]
        R2[R2: Real-time availability check<br/>ServiceBay + qualified Technician]
        R3[R3: Confirmed appointment record]
        R1 --> R2 --> R3
    end

    subgraph P4["Phase 4 — Testing"]
        P4a[Unit tests]
        P4b[Integration tests]
        P4c[Concurrency / edge cases]
    end

    subgraph P5["Phase 5 — Build for the Future"]
        P5a[Logging]
        P5b[Metrics]
        P5c[Tracing]
        P5d[Scalability / reliability notes]
    end

    subgraph P6["Phase 6 — Docs & Client Stub"]
        P6a[OpenAPI / cURL examples]
        P6b[README + AI Collaboration Narrative]
        P6c[System Design Document final]
    end

    subgraph P7["Phase 7 — Submission"]
        P7a[Video 5–10 min]
        P7b[Final checklist & submit]
    end

    P1 --> P2 --> P3 --> P4 --> P5 --> P6 --> P7

    AI[[AI collaboration log<br/>runs across all phases]] -.-> P1
